�To dice without slicing your finger, use a sharp knife and cut the food in a steady, controlled motion. Make sure to keep your fingers away from the blade and use a cutting board to protect your hands. For small items like herbs or garlic, use a rocking motion when cutting. If you are using a food processor or blender, be sure to keep your fingers away from the blades and only fill it halfway full. 

